<title>UK: LW Rentenbank sets 100 mln mark forex-linked bond.</title>
<headline>LW Rentenbank sets 100 mln mark forex-linked bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch Capital Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDWIRTSCHAFTLICHE RENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     *	   MATURITY  **25.FEB.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.125   PAY DATE    24.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.125     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ONCE ONLY</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.025     SELL CONC  0.10	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES     *ONCE ONLY PAYMENT LINKED TO ECU/DEM FOREX FORMULA</p>
<p>	    **REDEMPTION AMOUNT 100.125</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
